{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-q-exp-p-adic-table-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:q-exp-p-adic-table-data","kind":"table","title":"Data table from rem:q-exp-p-adic","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-q-exp-p-adic"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"q-exp-p-adic-table-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:q-exp-p-adic-table-data\"></a><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Base ring</th>\n<th>Does <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\exp_q</code> exist as a grouplike?</th>\n<th>Series convergence</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{Z}[q, q^{-1}]</code></td>\n<td>Yes (formal)</td>\n<td>Formal power series only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{C}</code> (or char-<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code>)</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Entire function of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{F}_p</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\in \\mathbb{F}_p^\\times</code>)</td>\n<td>Yes (formal symbol)</td>\n<td>Fails; replaced by <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\exp_q^{(p)}</code> mod <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x^p</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{Q}_p</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\in 1 + p\\mathbb{Z}_p</code>)</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Converges on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p\\mathbb{Z}_p</code> (Witt lift)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{C}_p</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\in 1 + p\\mathbb{Z}_p</code>)</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Converges on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">v_p(x) > 1/(p-1)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{C}_p</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">v_p(q-1) = 0</code></td>\n<td>Yes (formal)</td>\n<td>No convergence (order of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> in residue field)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-exp-p-adic-table-data.md","heading":"Table"}
